        },
        "text_MqBztk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>That wild idea and on-the-fly prototype became the starting point for what would eventually become Barreletics Performance Skins.<br/><br/>What followed was two years of trial and error, testing, redesigning, refining, and perfecting the details that mattered most: pressure points, fit, flexibility, materiality, and true all-over grip.<br/><br/>After countless iterations, Barreletics Performance Skins were born: patented workout footwear designed for barre, Pilates, reformer Pilates, Megaformer workouts, yoga, mat work, aquatic use, and studio fitness.<br/><br/><strong>Designed and manufactured in Michigan, USA,</strong> they were built to help you feel secure, stable, and connected without getting in the way of the workout.</p>",
            "text_custom": false,
            "text_font": "roboto_n4",
            "text_size": 16,
