        "text_VcGiT7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>My former career as a fashion model took me around the world, where I developed a deep appreciation for design, textiles, architecture, craftsmanship, innovation, and the details that elevate an experience.<br/><br/>That foundation in fashion now meets my passion for fitness, wellness, self-care, and living an active, healthy lifestyle.<br/><br/>Every pair of Barreletics is intentionally designed and crafted with care, not just to perform at the highest level, but to support how you move, feel, and show up.<br/><strong><br/>I hope you love them as much as I do.</strong><br/><br/><strong>Stefanie Miller<br/>Founder, Barreletics</strong></p>",
